    <text x="40" y="578" width="900" height="30" pointSize="14">Sum = A ⊕ B ⊕ Cin     Cout = (A ∧ B) ∨ ((A ⊕ B) ∧ Cin)</text>
    <text x="40" y="614" width="900" height="25" pointSize="11">输入 A、B、Cin 可切换 0 / 1；Sum 为本位和，Cout 为进位。</text>
